/// strings_tokenize -- explicit-state, reentrant tokenization.
///
/// SPEC.md Section 14: `Token borrows(input)` and
/// `next(input, separators, cursor: &mut TokenCursor) -> Option<Token>`.
/// The cursor is caller-owned; there is no module-global or thread-local
/// continuation state, and the input is never mutated (unlike C `strtok`).
///
/// Status: unimplemented (pre-F0). Depends on byte-slice support
/// (SPEC UP-004 / UP-005). Implementation begins at BL-055 (R0.2).
module strings_tokenize;
